# Escaped markup inside code

Every payload below is escaped text in the HTML, so it passes the sanitizer on purpose. Exported, it must stay code: never live raw HTML (#245).

```
<img src=x onerror=alert(1)>
```

```
<script>alert(1)</script>
```

`<script>alert(2)</script> A`

A span across a blank line: `first <img src=x onerror=alert(3)>` and a list marker: `x - <svg onload=alert(4)>`.

A carriage return by reference: `x <iframe src=javascript:alert(5)>`

`````
```
<script>alert(6)</script>
````
<img src=x onerror=alert(7)>
`````

Adjacent spans: `a` ``` ``<script>alert(8)</script> ```

Link syntax in code: `[x](javascript:alert(9))`

